title: $:/plugins/rimir/json-dsl/test/test-emit-indent-fallback
description: json-emit non-numeric indent attribute falls back to default (2)
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki-multiple
tags: [[$:/tags/wiki-test-spec]]

title: Output

\whitespace trim
<$json-obj>
<$json-prop key="a" value="1" type="number"/>
<$json-emit indent="abc"/>
</$json-obj>
+
title: ExpectedResult

<p>{
  "a": 1
}</p>
+
title: Narrative

`indent="abc"` parses to NaN; the widget must fall back to the documented default of 2 spaces instead of producing `NaN`-indented output.
